# Task Execution Checklist

## Understanding (truoc khi code)

- [ ] Da doc requirement lien quan (docs/02_requirement_analysis.md).
- [ ] Da doc docs lien quan (docs/03_system_design.md, docs/api/api-document.md).
- [ ] Da doc phan AGENTS.md lien quan (hoac cac rule tuong ung trong .cursor/rules/).
- [ ] Da kiem tra code hien tai (khong chi tin docs).
- [ ] Da xac dinh module + layer (project-structure.mdc).

## Implementation

- [ ] Dung module (theo 15 modules + 2 common).
- [ ] Dung layer (controller/service/repository/entity/dto/mapper/exception).
- [ ] KHONG business logic trong Controller.
- [ ] KHONG business logic trong Repository.
- [ ] Mapper dung convention MapStruct + Spring component.
- [ ] Error code dung prefix module (error-codes.mdc).
- [ ] Neu can WS -> qua FlashSaleWsBroadcaster (websocket.mdc).
- [ ] Neu can idempotency -> theo idempotency.mdc.
- [ ] Neu can JWT auth -> theo security.mdc.

## Database

- [ ] Constraint dung (FK, UNIQUE, NOT NULL, CHECK, Index).
- [ ] Migration moi neu can (V{n}__...sql).
- [ ] KHONG sua migration cu.
- [ ] KHONG sua docs/ (theo source-of-truth.mdc).
- [ ] Da rà soát migration-impact-matrix.mdc neu co migration moi.

## Flash Sale

- [ ] Redis operation atomic (Lua) - xem concurrency.mdc.
- [ ] Reservation TTL tach purchase limit - xem flashsale-purchase-limit.mdc.
- [ ] Rollback tra dung quantity (compensation idempotent) - xem flashsale-rollback.mdc.
