- [ ] Lifecycle operation idempotent - xem flashsale-lifecycle.mdc.

## Image

- [ ] Owner resolve dung (USER / STORE / PRODUCT / VARIANT / REVIEW).
- [ ] Ownership check truoc moi PATCH/DELETE.
- [ ] Co cascade xoa khi owner bi xoa.
- [ ] Chi 1 anh primary/owner.

## Security

- [ ] KHONG hard-code secret.
- [ ] Authorization dung (role/permission).
- [ ] Ownership check dung (vi du: address.user_id == current_user.id).
- [ ] KHONG bypass Security.

## Validation

- [ ] Input validation (Jakarta).
- [ ] Business validation (Service throw BusinessException).
- [ ] Edge cases (null, empty, max boundary, concurrent).

## Documentation Sync

- [ ] Da grep noi dung lien quan trong docs/.
